1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
1997: a fire on Mir filled the station
with smoke in minutes.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
In microgravity, fire behaves differently.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:13,000
FireGuard SI turns 26 NASA PSI combustion studies
into a live safety dashboard.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:20,000
It predicts fire risk in every ISS module —
and how fast fire spreads next door.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Its AI advisor tells the crew what to do,
citing the NASA experiment behind each step.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
FireGuard SI:
NASA fire science, one click from the crew.
